# CakePHP 6

Version-specific guidance for CakePHP 6.x (installed: {{ assist.packageVersion('cakephp/cakephp')|default('unknown') }}). CakePHP 6 is **not** backwards compatible with 5.x. Before upgrading, move to 5.4+ and clear deprecation warnings. Prefer the [6.0 Migration Guide](https://book.cakephp.org/6.x/appendices/6-0-migration-guide.html) and cakephp/upgrade for exhaustive rename lists.

## Breaking changes agents must know

- Leading-underscore protected methods and properties were renamed (underscore removed, or renamed for clarity). Do not invent `_saveMany`-style overrides — use the public/do* names from Cake 6 and the upgrade tool.
- Console command `execute` no longer receives `$args` / `$io` as parameters. Use `$this->args` and `$this->io` on the command instance.
- `EventManagerInterface::on()` swapped the 2nd and 3rd parameters (options moved after the callable). Prefer named parameters when registering listeners.
- `Text::uuid()` generates UUID **v7** strings (not v4).
- `Event::getSubject()` may return `null` when the event has no subject — do not assume a non-null subject.

@scoped(['config/app.php', 'config/app_local.php', 'config/**/*.php'])
## Datasource configuration

- Every datasource connection must define `username`, `password`, and `database`. Cake 6 removed default privileged credentials — never omit these keys.
- `ORM.mapJsonTypeForSqlite` was removed. SQLite maps columns with `json` in the name to `JsonType` by default.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Model/Entity/**', 'plugins/**/src/Model/Entity/**'])
## Entities (patchable)

- Entity `$_accessible` was renamed to `patchable`.
- Use `setPatchable()` / `getPatchable()` / `isPatchable()` instead of `setAccess()` / `getAccessible()` / `isAccessible()`.
- Query/save option `accessibleFields` was renamed to `patchableFields`.
- Prefer `hasValue()` over removed `EntityTrait::isEmpty()`.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Model/**', 'plugins/**/src/Model/**'])
## ORM and associations

- Prefer Cake 6 method names from the migration guide / upgrade tool (for example `doSaveMany()`, `doDeleteMany()`, association `doUnlink()`, TreeBehavior `doMoveUp()` / `doMoveDown()` / `doRemoveFromTree()`, SelectQuery `ormDecorateResults()` / `ormExecute()`).
- Do not reintroduce underscore-prefixed overrides that existed in 5.x.
@endscoped

@scoped(['config/routes.php', 'src/Application.php', 'src/Controller/**', 'plugins/**/src/Controller/**'])
## Routing

- `RouteBuilder::scope()`, `prefix()`, and `resources()` swapped the 2nd and 3rd parameters. Prefer named parameters.
- Attribute routing is available via `RouteBuilder::connectAttributes()` and `Cake\Routing\Attribute` (`#[Get]`, `#[Post]`, `#[Scope]`, `#[Resource]`, …). Use attributes when the application already adopts them; otherwise follow existing `config/routes.php` style.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Controller/**', 'plugins/**/src/Controller/**', 'src/Middleware/**'])
## HTTP request and pagination

- Do not use `$request->getParam('?')` for query params — use `$request->getQueryParams()`.
- Prefer public request helpers over removed `_getCookies()` / `_getJson()` / `_getXml()` / `_getHeaders()` / `_getBody()`.
- Prefer `$request->isType()` over removed `_is()`.
- `PaginatedInterface` extends `IteratorAggregate` (not only `Traversable`).
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Command/**', 'plugins/**/src/Command/**'])
## Console commands

- Implement `execute()` without `$args` / `$io` parameters; read `$this->args` and `$this->io`.
- Prefer `validateChoice()` over renamed `validChoice()` on console input arguments/options.
- Prefer renamed stream helpers such as `ConsoleOutput::writeStream()` when overriding output behavior.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Form/**', 'plugins/**/src/Form/**'])
## Forms

- Prefer `Form::process()` over removed `_execute()`.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Mailer/**', 'plugins/**/src/Mailer/**'])
## Mailer transports

- Prefer `connectSmtp()` / `disconnectSmtp()` on SMTP transports instead of underscore-prefixed connect/disconnect overrides.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/View/**', 'templates/**', 'plugins/**/templates/**', 'plugins/**/src/View/**'])
## Views and helpers

- `FileWidget` was removed — file inputs use the standard input widget.
- View `$_helpers` was renamed to `helperRegistry` (`$helpers` remains config).
- Prefer `View::renderFile()` over removed `_render()`.
- Prefer `PaginatorHelper::buildNumbers()` over removed `_numbers()`.
- Separate `escape` (content/labels) from `escapeAttributes` (HTML attributes); set both to `false` when neither should escape.
- Breadcrumb template key `title` → `content` where it means label/content, not an attribute.
- FormHelper template `multicheckboxTitle` → `multicheckboxLabel`.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/**', 'plugins/**/src/**'])
## Utility text and HTTP client

- `Text::insert()` placeholders default to `{foo}` (not `:foo`). Restore `:foo` only via `before` / `after` options when matching legacy templates.
- Prefer `Http\Client::processRequest()` (and stream adapter equivalents) over underscore-prefixed send helpers.
- Prefer Hash/Text/Xml `do*` method names from the migration guide when overriding internals.
@endscoped
